    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "What? The Synchro Dimension? But I'm supposed to be in the middle of a battle royal!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "You're like Yuya's twin, I mean triplet, I mean quadruplet! What's your name again? Was it Yoyo?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yugo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Yo-Yo!? My name is Yugo! You really aren't Rin. There's no way Rin would ever get my name wrong."
    },
    {
      "char": "yugo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Don't worry. You'll get used to being here. I remember how freaked out I was when I got sent to another dimension. That's the day I lost RinRin. We were inseparable… until we were separated."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
