      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Yugo reminisced about the moment Rin was captured."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuri",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "You're going to come with me. You can do this the easy way or the hard way... I hope it's the hard way."
    },
    {
      "char": "rin",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yugo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Let her go, creep! Don't do anything crazy, you got that?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuri",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I'm so sorry, but crazy is what I do best! Buh-bye!"
    },
    {
