    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Back in the present day, Zuzu informed Yugo about his mistake."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "That guy was Yuto. He doesn't have Rin. He's on a mission to save his friend's sister Lulu – just like you."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "duelchaser227",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "They were soon interrupted by an officer from Sector Security."
    },
    {
      "char": "duelchaser227",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Two \"Commons!\" The Villa is for Topsiders only!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yugo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "I knew we shouldn't have stayed there. We are in a restricted, Tops-only area. Off limits to us."
    },
    {
      "char": "yugo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Topsiders are the haves of society who possess all the wealth and power here in New Domino City. But down there in the slums… that's the area where us Commons have to live."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Doesn't seem fair."
    },
    {
      "char": "duelchaser227",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "This is Sector Security. Stop right there!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuzu",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yugo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Me run? No chance! Let's duel!"
    }
